1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:02,393
A homeowner wants solar.

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:04,936
All they know is one number from their bill.

3
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,561
They fill in a form,

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,468
and then they wait.

5
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:16,340
On the other side, an installer gets another lead that starts from zero.

6
00:00:17,900 --> 00:00:21,383
A planner will spend hours turning it into a design and a price.

7
00:00:24,600 --> 00:00:27,800
Reonic already connects installers and their customers.

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,343
We wanted to go… further.

9
00:00:34,450 --> 00:00:35,193
Meet reo.

10
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:43,137
An agentic companion, dropped onto the installer's website, doing the work in between.

11
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,600
On Sonnfeld's website, an advisor talks to the homeowner.

12
00:00:49,700 --> 00:00:51,372
A few taps: their usage,

13
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:52,743
an address,

14
00:00:55,500 --> 00:00:56,104
a car,

15
00:00:57,400 --> 00:00:58,561
and a heating system.

16
00:00:59,400 --> 00:01:01,443
And they get a design, a price range,

17
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:04,965
and a reason for every number.

18
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:09,047
Tap any number, and the advisor explains it.

19
00:01:13,600 --> 00:01:17,100
The planner opens the plan, and reo has already written the summary.

20
00:01:17,300 --> 00:01:21,600
Panels are placed on the satellite image, around the skylight and the rooftop units.

21
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:25,887
The planner moves, adds or removes modules, and the price follows.

22
00:01:26,400 --> 00:01:29,047
Every line of the breakdown follows the design.

23
00:01:29,600 --> 00:01:34,300
Then reo suggests the next steps: a calendar event for the site visit, a CRM task.

24
00:01:34,500 --> 00:01:36,822
A note, one click, and the quote is sent.

25
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:41,158
The customer sees their confirmed quote the same moment.

26
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:46,523
reo is an agent, not a chatbot: the engine, calendar, CRM and WhatsApp.

27
00:01:46,900 --> 00:01:49,176
One companion for every installer.

28
00:01:50,200 --> 00:01:55,400
Ten percent of Reonic's installers adopting reo: about seven hundred thousand dollars in new ARR.

29
00:01:55,800 --> 00:01:56,589
Thank you.
